sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Specialist team
  participant DB as Workflow database
  participant H as Human
  participant W as Worker
  participant P as Provider
  T->>DB: Freeze evidence and submit exact proposal
  Note over DB,H: Manager deadline passes while scheduler is stopped
  H->>DB: Late manager approval
  DB-->>H: Reject expired authority
  Note over DB: Scheduler resumes, supersedes manager, creates director task
  H->>DB: Director approves current proposal
  Note over DB,W: Decision and resume event persist while worker is down
  W->>DB: Resume, accept event, claim execution intent
  W->>P: Refund with stable operation key
  P->>P: Commit one ledger entry
  P--xW: Response lost
  W->>DB: Record unknown outcome
  W->>P: Query original operation key
  P-->>W: Existing receipt
  W->>DB: Reconcile and complete with receipt
